---
title: "script-chain"
---

// NOTE SX_ENTRY_MENU: The legacy player listed the package's scripts for the player to pick; a TeaseScript package starts at main.tease, so this menu offers each script that no other script chains to. The legacy player also chose a localized variant of a script by the system language, which the converted scripts do not, so these variants are not reached: chapters/first_de.tease.
say "Which script do you want to start?"
let picked = choose extra: "extra",
  intro: "intro",
  intro_de: "intro (Deutsch)"
switch picked {
  case "extra" {
    goto "extra.tease"
  }
  case "intro" {
    goto "intro.tease"
  }
  default {
    goto "intro_de.tease"
  }
}
